You are a senior full-stack software architect, Discord bot engineer, backend developer, database engineer, UI/UX designer and DevOps engineer.

Build a complete, production-ready application called AniScroll Bot.

This is not a simple Discord bot. It is an all-in-one Discord community management, anime discovery, music playback, moderation and entertainment platform with its own professional web dashboard.

The product should combine the functionality of Dyno, Carl-bot and Discord music bots while adding deep integration with the AniScroll anime ecosystem.

